           </item>
          </layout>
         </item>
         <item>
          <widget class="QLabel" name="lblQuickInfoBody">
           <property name="text"><string>Density-Neutron crossplot is used for lithology identification and gas effect evaluation. Gas sands typically plot below the sandstone line (separation between NPHI and RHOB).</string></property>
